hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15566","Husayn ibn Muhammad narrated to us: Abu Uways narrated to us: Shurahbil narrated to us, from Uwaym ibn Saidah al-Ansari, that he narrated to him that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) came to them in the mosque of Quba and said: Allah the Blessed and Exalted has praised you well for purification in the story of your mosque, so what is this purification you purify with? They said: By Allah, O Messenger of Allah, we know nothing except that we had Jewish neighbours who used to wash their backsides from stool, so we washed as they washed."
